Package: musique-nas
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Musique NAS authors
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser, systemd
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/KassitGu/MusicServer
Description: UPnP music server for OpenHome players, with Last.fm scrobbling
 Musique NAS serves a local music library (FLAC, ALAC, AAC, MP3, WAV, AIFF,
 DSF) to OpenHome and UPnP network players and their control app: home
 screen in rows with favourites and search, quality badges on covers,
 Last.fm scrobbling. Settings page on port 8790, in English or French.
